    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Quel'Danil Lodge is a center of communication for the high elves of the Hinterlands. Their ambassadors are working to establish relationships with other races, with whom they share their knowledge of the Witherbark trolls that inhabit the area in the southern Hinterlands. All of the documents regarding the communications are kept at the lodge.\n\nWe don't need the Highvale building alliances with others, {name}.\n\nDestroy the Highvale documents.  We need to burn their lines of communication... literally.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Burn the Highvale Records",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Burn the Highvale Notes",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Burn the Highvale Report",
          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity wants you to travel to the Hinterlands and burn the Highvale Records, Highvale Report, and Highvale Notes.",
      "title": "Lines of Communication",
